{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1760520678\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/60185ac884ea39a93f72288f7cf69f51.avif?t=1760520678\" width=577 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>About YesterSol</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a magical SolSpear!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it as a platform!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recall it back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a seed to roll through small places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.poster.avif?t=1760520678\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.webm?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/374591ee3a4c8f40affe94db27b97683.mp4?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an epic journey as Corin</strong>, a young Soladin\u2014a sun warrior in training. Armed with a magical SolSpear that doubles as a throw-able weapon and platform to stand on, you venture into a cursed land destroyed by Culex, an ancient evil once imprisoned in the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the origin of monstrous mosquito minions</strong> that ravaged your town, determined to prevent such devastation again. Journey into an ancient underground city sustained by a HeatSeed, generating endless steam. This city was once part of the SolLuna Kingdom, torn apart by a civil war born from differing beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.poster.avif?t=1760520678\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.webm?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/a4e6dd5d3a28cf4c9aec54a71e168b49.mp4?t=1760520678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate through the remnants of this kingdom, battle foes, and explore the ancient city</strong> to unearth a solution and numerous secrets. The fate of your people rests on your shoulders as you confront the shadows of a fractured past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248230/extras/641c6a78a33f955c4bc1ac70de643892.avif?t=1760520678\" width=577 height=66 /></span></p>","background":"https: